return evaluator(expr, data);","The rewritten expression reaches the Tournament evaluator, where the sandbox-bypassing payload is compiled and executed.","[{""code"":""	@Post('/:workflowId/run')"",""desc"":""@Post('/:workflowId/run') 路由装饰器标志着调用栈中从 HTTP 请求层流向工作流执行管道的起始节点，即 caller 侧的入口。此步骤中，用户在节点参数里嵌入的表达式字符串以请求体的形式到达控制器方法，随后作为待处理参数向 callee 层——即表达式解析逻辑——继续传递。在漏洞链路中，trace 自此处发端，用户可控的恶意表达式正是从这一节点开始逐级流入求值沙箱。"",""file"":""packages/cli/src/workflows/workflows.controller.ts"",""line"":539},{""code"":""		if (!isExpression(parameterValue)) {
			// Is no expression so return value
			return parameterValue;
		}

		// Is an expression

		// Remove the equal sign

		parameterValue = parameterValue.substr(1);"",""desc"":""expression.ts 第 384–393 行通过 isExpression 检查确认 parameterValue 以等号开头后，调用 substr(1) 剥离前缀符号，将剩余字符串作为纯表达式内容向 callee 传递，完成从 caller 控制器入口到 tournamentEvaluator 求值器的中间转接。此步骤仅验证字符串格式标记，不对表达式内容做任何安全审查。在漏洞链路中，含有 with 语句或保留变量重声明的恶意字符串经此预处理后，随后被送入沙箱编译流程，是攻击载荷穿越预处理门控的关键转接点。"",""file"":""packages/workflow/src/expression.ts"",""line"":""384-393""},{""code"":""const tournamentEvaluator = new Tournament(errorHandler, undefined, undefined, {
	before: [ThisSanitizer],
	after: [PrototypeSanitizer, DollarSignValidator],
});"",""desc"":""expression-evaluator-proxy.ts 第 9–12 行构造了 tournamentEvaluator 实例，将 ThisSanitizer 注册为 AST 前置钩子，将 PrototypeSanitizer 与 DollarSignValidator 注册为后置钩子，确立了表达式求值管道的防御架构。在调用栈下游，所有运行时表达式求值均经由此代理实例执行。在漏洞链路中，PrototypeSanitizer 在此处被绑定入钩子列表，其缺少 WithStatement 处理器的缺陷随同整个钩子配置一起传递至每次表达式编译，使后续每次求值都在存在缺陷的防御结构下运行。"",""file"":""packages/workflow/src/expression-evaluator-proxy.ts"",""line"":""9-12""},{""code"":""export const PrototypeSanitizer: ASTAfterHook = (ast, dataNode) => {"",""desc"":""PrototypeSanitizer 函数体定义于 expression-sandboxing.ts 第 244 行，作为 ASTAfterHook 在 tournamentEvaluator 每次编译表达式后被调用，接收来自上层传递的 ast 与 dataNode 参数，对 AST 节点执行属性访问合法性遍历。在调用栈下游的终点，此函数承担着清理危险节点的最终职责；然而由于缺少 visitWithStatement 处理器，with 语句节点在遍历时被跳过而不做任何处置。在漏洞链路中，这是防御失效的终止点：沙箱核心约束在此因缺位的节点类型处理而失效，最终为任意代码执行打开通道。"",""file"":""packages/workflow/src/expression-sandboxing.ts"",""line"":244}]","[{""code"":""	@Post('/:workflowId/run')"",""desc"":""The authenticated HTTP request starts execution of a saved workflow whose node parameters can contain the malicious expression."",""file"":""packages/cli/src/workflows/workflows.controller.ts"",""line"":539},{""code"":""	resolveSimpleParameterValue(
		parameterValue: NodeParameterValue,
		siblingParameters: INodeParameters,
		runExecutionData: IRunExecutionData | null,
		runIndex: number,
		itemIndex: number,
		activeNodeName: string,
		connectionInputData: INodeExecutionData[],
		mode: WorkflowExecuteMode,
		additionalKeys: IWorkflowDataProxyAdditionalKeys,
		executeData?: IExecuteData,
		returnObjectAsString = false,
		selfData = {},
		contextNodeName?: string,
	): NodeParameterValue | INodeParameters | NodeParameterValue[] | INodeParameters[] {"",""desc"":""The workflow parameter resolver accepts parameterValue and routes expression strings into the expression-processing pipeline."",""file"":""packages/workflow/src/expression.ts"",""line"":""368-382""},{""code"":""		if (!isExpression(parameterValue)) {
			// Is no expression so return value
			return parameterValue;
		}

		// Is an expression

		// Remove the equal sign

		parameterValue = parameterValue.substr(1);"",""desc"":""The expression prefix is recognized and removed without rejecting the reserved-name or with-statement payload used by the escape."",""file"":""packages/workflow/src/expression.ts"",""line"":""384-393""},{""code"":""		const extendedExpression = extendSyntax(parameterValue);
		const returnValue = this.renderExpression(extendedExpression, data);"",""desc"":""The user expression is syntax-expanded and passed to renderExpression for evaluation with the workflow data context."",""file"":""packages/workflow/src/expression.ts"",""line"":""452-453""},{""code"":""export const evaluateExpression: Evaluator = (expr, data) => {
	return evaluator(expr, data);"",""desc"":""The rewritten expression reaches the Tournament evaluator, where the sandbox-bypassing payload is compiled and executed."",""file"":""packages/workflow/src/expression-evaluator-proxy.ts"",""line"":""19-20""}]",Keep only the important data-flow or control-flow nodes from the entry point to the critical operation.

return evaluator(expr, data);",The rewritten expression reaches the Tournament evaluator here. This is the actual execution point after the sanitizer binding has been bypassed.,"{""code"":""export const sanitizer = (value: unknown): unknown => {
	const propertyKey = String(value);
	if (!isSafeObjectProperty(propertyKey)) {
		throw new ExpressionError(`Cannot access ""${propertyKey}"" due to security concerns`);
	}
	return propertyKey;
};"",""desc"":""sanitizer 是运行时属性键安全检查的核心实现：将传入值转为字符串后交由 isSafeObjectProperty 验证，若属性名属于危险范畴则抛出 ExpressionError 阻断访问。在漏洞链路中，此函数是防止通过属性链访问 constructor 等危险对象的最终防线，但当表达式用局部常量声明将 __sanitize 绑定遮蔽后，此函数不再被调用，保护机制因此完全失效。"",""file"":""packages/workflow/src/expression-sandboxing.ts"",""line"":""330-336""}","{""code"":""export const evaluateExpression: Evaluator = (expr, data) => {
	return evaluator(expr, data);"",""desc"":""The rewritten expression reaches the Tournament evaluator here. This is the actual execution point after the sanitizer binding has been bypassed."",""file"":""packages/workflow/src/expression-evaluator-proxy.ts"",""line"":""19-20""}","Point at the real execution, security decision, or bypass-enabling operation instead of a wrapper, static declaration, or defensive helper definition."

return evaluator(expr, data);",The Tournament evaluator compiles and executes the expression after the incomplete sandbox checks fail to stop the payload.,"[{""code"":""	resolveSimpleParameterValue(
		parameterValue: NodeParameterValue,
		siblingParameters: INodeParameters,
		runExecutionData: IRunExecutionData | null,
		runIndex: number,
		itemIndex: number,
		activeNodeName: string,
		connectionInputData: INodeExecutionData[],
		mode: WorkflowExecuteMode,
		additionalKeys: IWorkflowDataProxyAdditionalKeys,"",""desc"":""resolveSimpleParameterValue 的形参列表横跨多行，接收求值所需的全部运行时上下文：parameterValue 携带用户表达式，additionalKeys 等参数补充工作流状态。此段是从上游调用方（工作流执行引擎）流向本方法内部处理逻辑的入口截面，parameterValue 在此作为不可信输入首次出现在参数位置，随后将在方法体内被传入 extendSyntax 和 renderExpression 进行求值。"",""file"":""packages/workflow/src/expression.ts"",""line"":""368-377""},{""code"":""		Object.defineProperty(data, sanitizerName, {
			value: sanitizer,
			writable: false,
			configurable: false,
		});"",""desc"":""Object.defineProperty 以 writable:false、configurable:false 将 sanitizer 函数写入数据对象 data 的 sanitizerName（即 '__sanitize'）键下，意图在编译后的函数作用域内固化保护引用。在调用栈下游，此步骤是沙箱防护机制的装配点；然而当表达式通过 const ___n8n_data 声明局部变量遮蔽 data 对象本身时，这里写入的保护引用对遮蔽后的局部作用域不再可见，防御随之失效。"",""file"":""packages/workflow/src/expression.ts"",""line"":""434-438""},{""code"":""		const extendedExpression = extendSyntax(parameterValue);
		const returnValue = this.renderExpression(extendedExpression, data);"",""desc"":""extendSyntax 将用户表达式的原始字符串改写为经过 AST 转换的安全版本，在属性访问点插入 sanitizer 调用；随后 renderExpression 将转换结果与携带 sanitizer 引用的 data 对象绑定，编译并执行最终表达式。此步是从参数准备阶段流向代码执行阶段的关键转折，若上游的遮蔽或注入已破坏 sanitizer 绑定，恶意代码将在此处以沙箱名义获得实际的运行机会。"",""file"":""packages/workflow/src/expression.ts"",""line"":""452-453""},{""code"":""export const sanitizerName = '__sanitize';
const sanitizerIdentifier = b.identifier(sanitizerName);"",""desc"":""sanitizerName 被声明为字符串常量 '__sanitize'，同时 sanitizerIdentifier 将其封装为 AST 标识符节点，供语法改写阶段在属性访问表达式中插入调用占位符。在漏洞链路中，此处固定的字符串名称是保护机制的命名锚点：正是因为此键名在模块加载时已公开确定，表达式才能用同名局部常量精确遮蔽 data 对象上的 sanitizer 绑定，从而在调用栈下游绕过运行时属性检查。"",""file"":""packages/workflow/src/expression-sandboxing.ts"",""line"":""11-12""},{""code"":""export const sanitizer = (value: unknown): unknown => {
	const propertyKey = String(value);
	if (!isSafeObjectProperty(propertyKey)) {
		throw new ExpressionError(`Cannot access ""${propertyKey}"" due to security concerns`);
	}
	return propertyKey;
};"",""desc"":""sanitizer 函数以模块导出的形式在此处定义，与 critical_operation 所指代的是同一份实现：对每次属性访问传入的键名执行 isSafeObjectProperty 检查，一旦检测到 constructor 等敏感名称即抛出异常。在调用栈最下游，此处是 extendSyntax 在 AST 改写时插入的调用点在运行时最终解析到的目标函数体；若调用链任意一环（如 __sanitize 名称被局部声明遮蔽）切断了对此函数的引用，则后续所有属性访问均不再经过安全校验。"",""file"":""packages/workflow/src/expression-sandboxing.ts"",""line"":""330-336""}]","[{""code"":""	resolveSimpleParameterValue(
		parameterValue: NodeParameterValue,
		siblingParameters: INodeParameters,
		runExecutionData: IRunExecutionData | null,
		runIndex: number,
		itemIndex: number,
		activeNodeName: string,
		connectionInputData: INodeExecutionData[],
		mode: WorkflowExecuteMode,
		additionalKeys: IWorkflowDataProxyAdditionalKeys,
		executeData?: IExecuteData,
		returnObjectAsString = false,
		selfData = {},
		contextNodeName?: string,
	): NodeParameterValue | INodeParameters | NodeParameterValue[] | INodeParameters[] {"",""desc"":""The workflow parameter resolver accepts the user-controlled expression value and enters the expression-processing pipeline."",""file"":""packages/workflow/src/expression.ts"",""line"":""368-382""},{""code"":""		if (!isExpression(parameterValue)) {
			// Is no expression so return value
			return parameterValue;
		}

		// Is an expression

		// Remove the equal sign

		parameterValue = parameterValue.substr(1);"",""desc"":""The expression prefix is recognized and removed while the malicious syntax remains available to the later AST transformation."",""file"":""packages/workflow/src/expression.ts"",""line"":""384-393""},{""code"":""		Object.defineProperty(data, sanitizerName, {
			value: sanitizer,
			writable: false,
			configurable: false,
		});"",""desc"":""The host data object receives the __sanitize binding that the malicious expression attempts to shadow or bypass."",""file"":""packages/workflow/src/expression.ts"",""line"":""434-438""},{""code"":""		const extendedExpression = extendSyntax(parameterValue);
		const returnValue = this.renderExpression(extendedExpression, data);"",""desc"":""The transformed expression and workflow data are passed into renderExpression for evaluator execution."",""file"":""packages/workflow/src/expression.ts"",""line"":""452-453""},{""code"":""export const evaluateExpression: Evaluator = (expr, data) => {
	return evaluator(expr, data);"",""desc"":""The Tournament evaluator compiles and executes the expression after the incomplete sandbox checks fail to stop the payload."",""file"":""packages/workflow/src/expression-evaluator-proxy.ts"",""line"":""19-20""}]",Keep only the important data-flow or control-flow nodes from the entry point to the critical operation.

}",Webhook responseHeaders are evaluated from workflow configuration and each user-controlled value is inserted unchanged into the response-header map.,"{""code"":""		}"",""desc"":""webhook-helpers.ts 第 615 行是 streaming 分支代码块的结束边界，标志着 res 对象已被完整写入 runData.httpResponse 并将 didSendResponse 置为 true。此时响应对象携带的 content-type 值——包括任何首尾空白字符——已无条件进入后续处理流程，构成污染链路的起始入口；任何对该头部值的校验缺失均会在下游持续传播。"",""file"":""packages/cli/src/webhooks/webhook-helpers.ts"",""line"":615}","{""code"":""	const evaluatedHeaders =
		context.evaluateComplexWebhookDescriptionExpression<WebhookNodeResponseHeaders>(
			'responseHeaders',
		);
	if (evaluatedHeaders?.entries === undefined) {
		return headers;
	}

	for (const entry of evaluatedHeaders.entries) {
		headers.set(entry.name.toLowerCase(), entry.value);
	}"",""desc"":""Webhook responseHeaders are evaluated from workflow configuration and each user-controlled value is inserted unchanged into the response-header map."",""file"":""packages/cli/src/webhooks/webhook-helpers.ts"",""line"":""882-892""}","Move or retain the node that best represents external input, workflow configuration, request handling, or parameter entry into the vulnerable chain."

