globalThis.__data.__sanitize = __sanitize;","The guard is installed with a writable assignment on expression-reachable __data, so the payload can neutralize every inserted check.","[{""code"":""	private renderExpression(expression: string, data: IWorkflowDataProxyData) {"",""desc"":""renderExpression 是调用链从宿主层进入沙箱的起始段，从外部 caller 接收 expression 字符串后调用 evaluate，将控制流传递至 VM 沙箱内部的 callee；随后 PrototypeSanitizer 的编译期 AST 变换以此次触发为前提，执行路径再向下游延伸至 reset.ts 中 __sanitize 的初始化赋值，构成整条防护链的入口环节。"",""file"":""packages/workflow/src/expression.ts"",""line"":524},{""code"":""				path.replace(
					b.memberExpression(
						// eslint-disable-next-line @typescript-eslint/no-unsafe-argument, @typescript-eslint/no-explicit-any
						node.object as any,
						// eslint-disable-next-line @typescript-eslint/no-unsafe-argument
